# Save the Children (San d'Oria 1-3) at Ambrotien: a first completion there. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria, rank 1
# with 1-1 and 1-2 completed (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Ambrotien's script opens the mission list
# 2009; option 102: begun, Status 1 (Southern San d'Oria's 2009). Status 4 (a GM; the fight is
# battlefield.save_the_children's): Ambrotien 2004 (not completed); finished: rank 2, 1000 gil, completed, Option 1.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2004
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=93.4,0,-55.5 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
login
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 1: his script's mission list 2009
finish option=102                       # begun, Status 1
missionstatus Sandoria 4                # a GM: the fight and the hut done
trigger Ambrotien                       # section 4, not completed: 2004
finish                                  # rank 2, 1000 gil, completed, Option 1
